The Extravaganza is our biggest day of the year - a whole afternoon of music, food and family fun, and our annual fundraiser for the community [swimming pool we're working to bring back](/facilities/pool).

There's something for everyone on the day:

- ~~**Dog show**~~ ~~- bring your four-legged friend along~~ - **Canceled** due risk to hot paws
- **DJs -** Tunes from [Ru](https://www.mixcloud.com/ru-davies/) and Chris 12-3 (raffle at 4) then [**Nursey grime**](https://www.instagram.com/nursery.grime)
- **Football tournaments** - sponsored by [Aspect Deco](https://www.facebook.com/aspect.deco/). Contact [Totnes and Dartington FC](https://www.totnesanddartingtonfc.co.uk) (early start)
- **Games and stalls**
- **Bouncy castles** from [Totnes Castles](https://www.facebook.com/totnes.castles/)
- [**Frazoo**](https://www.frazoo.co.uk) - 12 - 3  an exciting and educational animal experience, featuring ​talks&nbsp;and handling sessions with a variety of reptiles and invertebrates
- **Sparkly magic** from [Alexia Love](https://www.instagram.com/houseofhigherheart/) 12:30 - 2
- **Family saunas** with [Somewhere Sauna](https://www.thesomewheresauna.com/dartington) cold plunge and story telling from [Mica Sinclair](https://www.instagram.com/micasinclair) 12:30, 1 and 1:30. - all income from ticket sales goes straight to the pool project. [Book now](https://app.acuityscheduling.com/schedule/8e735c9f/?appointmentTypeIds%5B%5D=94966625)
- **Wacky Races** - Fun and games on the Bike track and MUGA. Thanks to [KOM Cycle coaching](https://www.komcoaching.uk).
- **Raffle** - Prize announcements coming soon.
- **Hair colouring**
- **Massage** - From [KOM](https://www.komcoaching.uk/sports-massage-therapy/) 12-2, [Sabrina Hall](https://www.instagram.com/iamsabrinahall/) 2-5
- **Cake sale** - [let us know](mailto:extravaganza@meadowbrookdartington.org) if you'd like to donate a cake
- **BBQ** - run by [Volunteers](https://www.meadowbrookdartington.org/content/volunteer)
- **Pizza** from [Pizzalogica](https://pizzalogica.uk)
- **Kebabs** from [The Big Kababski](https://www.facebook.com/thebigkebabski/)
- **Drinks** from [Things Happen Here](https://thingshappenhere.co.uk)
- **About the Pool & The DRA** - come and share your thoughts on the future of Meadowbrook and the pool

### Can you lend a hand?

We rely on volunteers to make the day happen, and we'd love your help. We're looking for people to:

- ~~Help man the stalls~~
- ~~Run the BBQ~~
- Help set up in the morning and pack down at the end
- [~~Deliver leaflets~~](/deliver-leaflets) ~~to spread the word~~

Even an hour or two makes a real difference. [Email the team](mailto:extravaganza@meadowbrookdartington.org) and we'll find you a spot.
